<title>USA: US soybean sales to China 52,500 w/e April 24 - USDA.</title>
<headline>US soybean sales to China 52,500 w/e April 24 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean sales to China in the week ended April 24 totaled 52,500 tonnes, U.S. Agriculture Department said Thursday in its weekly export sales report.</p>
</text>
